{"real": false, "dur": 76.63, "sent": [{"start": 0.4, "end": 7.71, "text": "A word about how I built this, since the title talks about an AI platform with no development team.", "words": [{"w": "A", "s": 0.4}, {"w": "word", "s": 0.78}, {"w": "about", "s": 1.17}, {"w": "how", "s": 1.55}, {"w": "I", "s": 1.94}, {"w": "built", "s": 2.32}, {"w": "this,", "s": 2.71}, {"w": "since", "s": 3.09}, {"w": "the", "s": 3.48}, {"w": "title", "s": 3.86}, {"w": "talks", "s": 4.25}, {"w": "about", "s": 4.63}, {"w": "an", "s": 5.02}, {"w": "AI", "s": 5.4}, {"w": "platform", "s": 5.78}, {"w": "with", "s": 6.17}, {"w": "no", "s": 6.55}, {"w": "development", "s": 6.94}, {"w": "team.", "s": 7.32}]}, {"start": 8.06, "end": 10.75, "text": "I built FluOLinGo with AI coding tools.", "words": [{"w": "I", "s": 8.06}, {"w": "built", "s": 8.44}, {"w": "FluOLinGo", "s": 8.83}, {"w": "with", "s": 9.21}, {"w": "AI", "s": 9.6}, {"w": "coding", "s": 9.98}, {"w": "tools.", "s": 10.37}]}, {"start": 11.1, "end": 16.48, "text": "They’re fast, and they made it possible for someone like me, who can’t code.", "words": [{"w": "They’re", "s": 11.1}, {"w": "fast,", "s": 11.48}, {"w": "and", "s": 11.87}, {"w": "they", "s": 12.25}, {"w": "made", "s": 12.64}, {"w": "it", "s": 13.02}, {"w": "possible", "s": 13.41}, {"w": "for", "s": 13.79}, {"w": "someone", "s": 14.18}, {"w": "like", "s": 14.56}, {"w": "me,", "s": 14.95}, {"w": "who", "s": 15.33}, {"w": "can’t", "s": 15.72}, {"w": "code.", "s": 16.1}]}, {"start": 16.83, "end": 19.53, "text": "But they can get the teaching wrong.", "words": [{"w": "But", "s": 16.83}, {"w": "they", "s": 17.22}, {"w": "can", "s": 17.6}, {"w": "get", "s": 17.99}, {"w": "the", "s": 18.37}, {"w": "teaching", "s": 18.76}, {"w": "wrong.", "s": 19.14}]}, {"start": 19.88, "end": 21.42, "text": "Here’s a real example.", "words": [{"w": "Here’s", "s": 19.88}, {"w": "a", "s": 20.26}, {"w": "real", "s": 20.65}, {"w": "example.", "s": 21.03}]}, {"start": 21.77, "end": 25.61, "text": "Remember the lesson page, with one exercise and three levels?", "words": [{"w": "Remember", "s": 21.77}, {"w": "the", "s": 22.15}, {"w": "lesson", "s": 22.53}, {"w": "page,", "s": 22.92}, {"w": "with", "s": 23.3}, {"w": "one", "s": 23.69}, {"w": "exercise", "s": 24.07}, {"w": "and", "s": 24.46}, {"w": "three", "s": 24.84}, {"w": "levels?", "s": 25.23}]}, {"start": 25.96, "end": 30.19, "text": "Earlier AI helpers broke that up into lots of separate activities.", "words": [{"w": "Earlier", "s": 25.96}, {"w": "AI", "s": 26.35}, {"w": "helpers", "s": 26.73}, {"w": "broke", "s": 27.12}, {"w": "that", "s": 27.5}, {"w": "up", "s": 27.88}, {"w": "into", "s": 28.27}, {"w": "lots", "s": 28.65}, {"w": "of", "s": 29.04}, {"w": "separate", "s": 29.42}, {"w": "activities.", "s": 29.81}]}, {"start": 30.54, "end": 37.85, "text": "Each looked fine by itself, but the teaching idea behind it was gone, and only a teacher would notice.", "words": [{"w": "Each", "s": 30.54}, {"w": "looked", "s": 30.93}, {"w": "fine", "s": 31.31}, {"w": "by", "s": 31.7}, {"w": "itself,", "s": 32.08}, {"w": "but", "s": 32.47}, {"w": "the", "s": 32.85}, {"w": "teaching", "s": 33.23}, {"w": "idea", "s": 33.62}, {"w": "behind", "s": 34.0}, {"w": "it", "s": 34.39}, {"w": "was", "s": 34.77}, {"w": "gone,", "s": 35.16}, {"w": "and", "s": 35.54}, {"w": "only", "s": 35.93}, {"w": "a", "s": 36.31}, {"w": "teacher", "s": 36.7}, {"w": "would", "s": 37.08}, {"w": "notice.", "s": 37.47}]}, {"start": 38.2, "end": 41.28, "text": "I’ve found two things that help prevent that.", "words": [{"w": "I’ve", "s": 38.2}, {"w": "found", "s": 38.58}, {"w": "two", "s": 38.97}, {"w": "things", "s": 39.35}, {"w": "that", "s": 39.74}, {"w": "help", "s": 40.12}, {"w": "prevent", "s": 40.51}, {"w": "that.", "s": 40.89}]}, {"start": 41.63, "end": 49.32, "text": "First, I write down my teaching decisions in plain language and make sure the AI always has access to them.", "words": [{"w": "First,", "s": 41.63}, {"w": "I", "s": 42.01}, {"w": "write", "s": 42.4}, {"w": "down", "s": 42.78}, {"w": "my", "s": 43.17}, {"w": "teaching", "s": 43.55}, {"w": "decisions", "s": 43.93}, {"w": "in", "s": 44.32}, {"w": "plain", "s": 44.7}, {"w": "language", "s": 45.09}, {"w": "and", "s": 45.47}, {"w": "make", "s": 45.86}, {"w": "sure", "s": 46.24}, {"w": "the", "s": 46.63}, {"w": "AI", "s": 47.01}, {"w": "always", "s": 47.4}, {"w": "has", "s": 47.78}, {"w": "access", "s": 48.17}, {"w": "to", "s": 48.55}, {"w": "them.", "s": 48.93}]}, {"start": 49.67, "end": 56.21, "text": "Second, I look at the actual screen myself, because the AI’s description of it can be wrong.", "words": [{"w": "Second,", "s": 49.67}, {"w": "I", "s": 50.05}, {"w": "look", "s": 50.44}, {"w": "at", "s": 50.82}, {"w": "the", "s": 51.21}, {"w": "actual", "s": 51.59}, {"w": "screen", "s": 51.98}, {"w": "myself,", "s": 52.36}, {"w": "because", "s": 52.75}, {"w": "the", "s": 53.13}, {"w": "AI’s", "s": 53.52}, {"w": "description", "s": 53.9}, {"w": "of", "s": 54.28}, {"w": "it", "s": 54.67}, {"w": "can", "s": 55.05}, {"w": "be", "s": 55.44}, {"w": "wrong.", "s": 55.82}]}, {"start": 56.56, "end": 61.94, "text": "Those written rules help stop the AI from making teaching decisions on its own.", "words": [{"w": "Those", "s": 56.56}, {"w": "written", "s": 56.94}, {"w": "rules", "s": 57.33}, {"w": "help", "s": 57.71}, {"w": "stop", "s": 58.1}, {"w": "the", "s": 58.48}, {"w": "AI", "s": 58.87}, {"w": "from", "s": 59.25}, {"w": "making", "s": 59.63}, {"w": "teaching", "s": 60.02}, {"w": "decisions", "s": 60.4}, {"w": "on", "s": 60.79}, {"w": "its", "s": 61.17}, {"w": "own.", "s": 61.56}]}, {"start": 62.29, "end": 69.22, "text": "And because every rule comes from a specific source, I can check whether the AI has followed it.", "words": [{"w": "And", "s": 62.29}, {"w": "because", "s": 62.68}, {"w": "every", "s": 63.06}, {"w": "rule", "s": 63.45}, {"w": "comes", "s": 63.83}, {"w": "from", "s": 64.22}, {"w": "a", "s": 64.6}, {"w": "specific", "s": 64.98}, {"w": "source,", "s": 65.37}, {"w": "I", "s": 65.75}, {"w": "can", "s": 66.14}, {"w": "check", "s": 66.52}, {"w": "whether", "s": 66.91}, {"w": "the", "s": 67.29}, {"w": "AI", "s": 67.68}, {"w": "has", "s": 68.06}, {"w": "followed", "s": 68.45}, {"w": "it.", "s": 68.83}]}, {"start": 69.57, "end": 72.64, "text": "You can check my decisions the same way.", "words": [{"w": "You", "s": 69.57}, {"w": "can", "s": 69.95}, {"w": "check", "s": 70.33}, {"w": "my", "s": 70.72}, {"w": "decisions", "s": 71.1}, {"w": "the", "s": 71.49}, {"w": "same", "s": 71.87}, {"w": "way.", "s": 72.26}]}, {"start": 72.99, "end": 75.68, "text": "The teacher has to stay the author.", "words": [{"w": "The", "s": 72.99}, {"w": "teacher", "s": 73.38}, {"w": "has", "s": 73.76}, {"w": "to", "s": 74.15}, {"w": "stay", "s": 74.53}, {"w": "the", "s": 74.92}, {"w": "author.", "s": 75.3}]}]}